OL,5,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FWith North Yorkshire's roads a big
OL,7,     Fdraw for bikers, policing them is
OL,8,     Fa top priority. A 70-year-old
OL,9,     Fbiker crashes down an embankment
OL,10,     Fbut is spared serious injury
OL,11,     Fthanks to a gadget.
OL,12,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FAction-packed observational
OL,14,     Fdocumentary series. Andy has a
OL,15,     Fhigh-speed chase through a housing
OL,16,     Festate and Kev pays an
OL,17,     Fearly-morning visit to a drug
OL,18,     Fdealer.
