OL,5,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FDamo and the firearms team tackle
OL,7,     Fa supermarket gunman, while Gareth
OL,8,     Ffaces a death-defying pursuit
OL,9,     Falong roads and back alleys.
OL,10,G1600 Police Interceptors
OL,11,     FBen Sutcliffe takes presenter Rick
OL,12,     FEdwards through interceptor
OL,13,     Ftraining. And Kev Salter goes on
OL,14,     Fdrugs busts, accompanied by rookie
OL,15,     FPete Tate on two of them.
OL,16,G1700 Rogue Claimers
OL,17,     FA claim over a staged house fire
OL,18,     Fgoes up in smoke and in the USA a
OL,19,     Fhusband commits the ultimate evil
OL,20,     Fact to cash in on his wife's life
OL,21,     Finsurance.
