OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FThe team continues to work
OL,7,     Ftogether to help the ill and
OL,8,     Finjured of South Yorkshire, aiding
OL,9,     Fpatients suffer-ing from heart
OL,10,     Fattacks, road traffic collisions
OL,11,     Fand allergic reactions.
OL,12,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,13,     FMedics rush to a 60-year-old woman
OL,14,     Fwith suspected multiple injuries,
OL,15,     Ftrapped in her car, and to a
OL,16,     F36-year-old knife attack victim,
OL,17,     Fwho has extensive injuries to his
OL,18,     Fneck and face.
