OL,5,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FAfter a terrible accident on his
OL,7,     Fbike, a man has an excruciating
OL,8,     Ftear on his chin. A man is rushed
OL,9,     Fin, escorted by police with a
OL,10,     Fsuspected overdose. A cyclist has
OL,11,     Fbeen hit by a car.
OL,12,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Adil tries to help a Glaswegian
OL,14,     Fhiding a large cyst under his hat
OL,15,     Fand Dr Dev long arms a lipoma from
OL,16,     Fa Lancashire detective. Dr Emma
OL,17,     Fcontends with lumps on a ribcage
OL,18,     Fand a cheek.
