OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FAs a heatwave hits Barnsley,
OL,7,     Fpressure increases for sister Jane
OL,8,     Fin casualty. Among those seeking
OL,9,     Femergency treatment are
OL,10,     F65-year-old Theresa, with a
OL,11,     Fpossible stroke.
OL,12,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Natalia tackles an awkward
OL,14,     Flipoma, and a large underarm lump
OL,15,     Fisn't what it seems when Dr Dev
OL,16,     Fstarts to operate - will he be
OL,17,     Fable to get patient Lisa ready for
OL,18,     Fher daughter's wedding?
